scope:
The grade covers 2208.09014 v1 and v3, both read at source, under GKLP's stated hypotheses: flat M4xS1, a brane moving along the compact direction at constant beta, constant-velocity brane observers boosted by B, and a free massless bulk scalar. It covers the tree's uses at D13, at D21 and latticectc, in the 2208.09014 clause of the superseded O6 sentence, in branelink's eq. (22) citation, and in the W7 threshold.

It does NOT cover:
- the PRD 107, 025016 published version, which was not read;
- the 2206.13590 half of O6's 'neither GKLP paper', which is a different key;
- interacting fields, which GKLP state only as an expectation;
- Kabat & Nomura 2309.05759, which was not re-read.
